{"unit_id": "tag:02Z0:prose-0005", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n例如，由此引理可知，若<MATH_0001>是有限（finite）Galois扩张（Galois extension），则<MATH_0002>。若扩张无限（infinite）会怎样？下面是一个例子。\n\n", "allowed_english": ["Galois"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "Galois extension", "target_term": "Galois扩张"}, {"source_term": "infinite", "target_term": "无限"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "扩张性质，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "Galois extension", "target_term": "Galois扩张", "context": "引理所用扩张，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "infinite", "target_term": "无限", "context": "下面考虑的扩张性质，暂定译法。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02Z6:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>。设<MATH_0002>。设<MATH_0003>，在<MATH_0004>上带有显然的作用。于是按构造，引理<REF_0001>的性质<MATH_0005>成立，得到代数空间（algebraic space）\n<MATH_0006>\n当然，这作为<MATH_0007>的近似完全荒谬！具体地，由Artin-Schreier定理，参见<REF_0002>，<MATH_0008>的有限（finite）子群（subgroups）只有<MATH_0009>以及二阶群（group）<MATH_0010>的共轭。因而，若<MATH_0011>是态射（morphism），且<MATH_0012>代数（algebraic）于<MATH_0013>之上，则由引理<REF_0003>和刚才提到的定理，<MATH_0014>要么是<MATH_0015>，要么同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0016>。\n", "allowed_english": ["Artin-Schreier"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "subgroups", "target_term": "子群"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "所构造的商，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "子群性质，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "subgroups", "target_term": "子群", "context": "Galois群的子群，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "group", "target_term": "群", "context": "二阶群，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "域值点，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "algebraic", "target_term": "代数", "context": "域扩张性质，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构", "context": "域值点的分类，暂定译法。"}], "notes": []}
