{"unit_id": "tag:02Z7:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是特征（characteristic）零的域（field）。设<MATH_0002>，并设<MATH_0003>。取作用为<MATH_0004>，即<MATH_0005>在仿射（affine）直线上的平移作用。唯一的固定点（fixed point）是泛点（generic point），而且显然<MATH_0006>嵌入域（field）<MATH_0007>的自同构群（automorphism group）。（此处用到了特征（characteristic）零的假设。）考虑态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0008>\n从仿射（affine）直线的泛点（generic point）到商（quotient）。我们断言，这个态射（morphism）不通过任何单态射（monomorphism）<MATH_0009>分解，后者从一个域（field）的谱（spectrum）到<MATH_0010>。（这与概形（schemes）的情形不同，参见概形（Schemes）中的节<REF_0001>。）事实上，由于<MATH_0011>没有任何非平凡有限（finite）子群（subgroups），由引理<REF_0002>，对于任何这样的分解都有<MATH_0012>。最后，<MATH_0013>不是单态射（monomorphism），因为\n<MATH_0014>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "characteristic", "target_term": "特征"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "fixed point", "target_term": "固定点"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "automorphism group", "target_term": "自同构群"}, {"source_term": "characteristic", "target_term": "特征"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "monomorphism", "target_term": "单态射"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "subgroups", "target_term": "子群"}, {"source_term": "monomorphism", "target_term": "单态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "characteristic", "target_term": "特征", "context": "基域的特征，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "基域和泛点域，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "作用的直线，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "fixed point", "target_term": "固定点", "context": "作用的固定点，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "generic point", "target_term": "泛点", "context": "仿射直线的泛点，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "automorphism group", "target_term": "自同构群", "context": "泛点域的自同构群，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "泛点到商的态射，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "quotient", "target_term": "商", "context": "群作用的商，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "monomorphism", "target_term": "单态射", "context": "不能作为分解的态射，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "spectrum", "target_term": "谱", "context": "域的谱，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "对比的对象，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "Schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引用章节名，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "子群的性质，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "subgroups", "target_term": "子群", "context": "加法群的子群，暂定译法。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:02Z0:prose-0007", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n这个例子提示，为定义代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0001>的点，应当考虑从域（fields）的谱到<MATH_0002>的态射（morphisms）的等价类（equivalence classes），而不是从域（fields）的谱出发的单态射（monomorphisms）的集合（set）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n最后给出一个实在糟糕的例子。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "fields", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "equivalence classes", "target_term": "等价类"}, {"source_term": "fields", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "monomorphisms", "target_term": "单态射"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间", "context": "待定义点的对象，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "fields", "target_term": "域", "context": "测试域，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "域谱到空间的态射，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "equivalence classes", "target_term": "等价类", "context": "定义点所用等价类，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "monomorphisms", "target_term": "单态射", "context": "不适合定义点的态射，暂定译法。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "单态射的集合，暂定译法。"}], "notes": []}
